# The Dockerfiles copy whole project directories, so the build context has to
# exclude anything the image installs or produces itself. pnpm's node_modules in
# particular is a tree of symlinks that does not survive a COPY.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Generated Prisma output; the builder stage regenerates it.
**/generated

.git
.github
.vscode
.idea

# .husky is kept in the context: pnpm still runs the `prepare` script, and
# .husky/install.mjs is what reads HUSKY=0 to opt out.

# Agent and editor scratch space
**/.agents
**/.claude
**/.cursor
**/.devin

*.log
.DS_Store
